cGRASP
======

This repository contains a prototype implementation of cGRASP (constrained
GRASP) over CoAP.

It is derived from "graspy", the Python demonstration implementation of GRASP
(RFC 8990) and its API (RFC 8991), maintained by Brian E Carpenter:

    https://github.com/becarpenter/graspy

The upstream code is distributed under the Revised BSD License; the full
license text is in the LICENSE file of this repository. Upstream copyright
notices are retained in the source files that originate from graspy.

The cGRASP-over-CoAP work was developed against
draft-ietf-anima-constrained-grasp. The Internet-Draft is a work product of
the IETF ANIMA working group and is subject to the IETF Trust Legal
Provisions; it is not part of this repository's source code.

Unless stated otherwise, files added by the cGRASP project are also
distributed under the BSD 3-Clause License (see LICENSE).
